# Everything here except __init__.py is generated by
# ../../scripts/build_native.py and must never be committed — the generated
# bkndb_ffi.py and its compiled library are matched by a UniFFI contract
# checksum; committing one without the other (freshly built together) risks
# a stale, silently-mismatched pair.
bkndb_ffi.py
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
